WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:03.611
The agent says, "The system imports all your email into a

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:07.140
shared dashboard." The owner corrects it: "Only the

00:00:07.198 --> 00:00:10.553
website form is in the first version; I have not decided

00:00:10.612 --> 00:00:11.598
on email imports.

00:00:11.923 --> 00:00:15.813
The list is private, not shared." A good agent updates the

00:00:15.883 --> 00:00:18.402
readback and keeps those two distinctions visible.

00:00:18.843 --> 00:00:21.967
If the owner says "That is right," capture the resulting

00:00:22.025 --> 00:00:22.466
journey.

00:00:22.849 --> 00:00:25.217
If the owner says "Almost," keep listening.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.352
A correction is a normal part of the process, not a

00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:30.407
failure of the owner to prompt perfectly.
